OL,3,GNEWSADriver who ignored warnings jailed
OL,4,Afor fatal crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who ignored doctors' warnings not
OL,7,Fto drive has been jailed for killing a
OL,8,Fpensioner in a head-on crash.
OL,10,FNoel Peter Collins, 35, killed
OL,11,F75-year-old George Jackson when his
OL,12,FToyota RAV4 veered on the wrong side of
OL,13,Fthe A595 in Cumbria in July 2024,
OL,14,Fhitting Jackson's Honda Civic.
OL,16,FCarlisle Crown Court heard Collins had
OL,17,Ffailed to disclose a diagnosis of
OL,18,Fprobable temporal lobe epilepsy to the
OL,19,FDriving Vehicle Agency (DVA) in his
OL,20,Fnative Northern Ireland, knowing it
OL,21,Fwould likely result in the loss of his
OL,22,Flicence.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
